## 🗄️ Database Schema (prisma/schema.prisma)

```prisma
User
  ├── id, email, name, password, avatar
  ├── sentMessages
  ├── receivedMessages
  ├── notifications
  └── conversations (through ConversationParticipant)

Conversation
  ├── id, createdAt, updatedAt
  ├── participants (through ConversationParticipant)
  └── messages

ConversationParticipant
  ├── conversationId + userId (UNIQUE)
  └── links Users ↔ Conversations

Message
  ├── id, content, type (TEXT/IMAGE/FILE/SYSTEM)
  ├── status (SENT/DELIVERED/READ/FAILED)
  ├── senderId → User
  ├── receiverId → User (optional, for 1-on-1)
  ├── conversationId → Conversation
  └── createdAt, updatedAt

Notification
  ├── userId
  ├── title, message
  ├── type (MESSAGE/FRIEND_REQUEST/SYSTEM/MENTION)
  ├── read: false
  └── data: Json
```

