## 🎨 Frontend State Management (Redux + RTK Query)

```typescript
Redux Store:
  chat: {
    activeConversationId: string | null,
    typingUsers: { [conversationId]: userId[] },
    unreadCount: number,
    unreadConversations: { [conversationId]: count },
    notifications: Notification[]
  }

RTK Query Cache:
  getConversations → Array of conversations
  getMessages → Array of messages for a conversation
```

